window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In the second book in the Intertwine series, small-town boy James is thrust into a realm of demons, deceit, and the supernatural. When his father bargains James' soul for riches, his watcher Anne must make harrowing choices and confront malevolent forces intent on taking what is owed. As Anne makes a fateful sacrifice to protect James, repercussions unfold, plunging his life into a world of trauma, heartbreak, and turmoil. Can James endure the chaos that now engulfs him?</p> <p>Experience a world of passion, lust, betrayal, and the unknown. Where love and danger collide in a gripping tale of suspense and mystery.</p> <p>Trigger warnings include: erotica/smut, obsessive and possessive behavior, violence, gore, explicit language, kidnapping, murder, torture, blood play, BDSM, submissive play, gag play, edging, spanking, breathing play (chocking), threesomes, imprisonment, grief, drug use and abuse, drug and human trafficking, divorce, cheating, fat shaming, sexual assault, and suicide.</p>"; 
